START
Create an empty list to store users
Repeat for each user
Ask the user to enter their name
WHILE the name is empty
Ask again for a valid name
END WHILE
Set number score to 50
Set pattern tracker to 0
Set all colour scores to 0
FOR question number from 1 to 10
Display the question with two choices
Get the user’s selected answer
IF question number is between 1 and 5
 Adjust the number score based on the answer
  Update the pattern tracker
   END IF
IF question number is between 6 and 10
 Add points to colour scores based on the answer
 END IF
   END FOR
    IF number score is less than 0
        Set number score to 0
    END IF
    IF number score is greater than 100
        Set number score to 100
    END IF
    Find the colour with the highest score
    Save the user’s name, predicted number, and predicted colour
    Display the result
Repeat for next user
END

